Package: scgtest
Type: Package
Title: Differential Expression Testing for Single-Cell RNA-Seq
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Mengrui", "Zhang",
                  email = "mrzhang@stanford.edu",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for differential expression testing on single-cell and
    pseudobulk RNA-seq data, including edgeR-based tests, optional RUV
    correction, Wilcoxon pairwise tests, pathway enrichment with
    clusterProfiler, and common visualization helpers.
